{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a7bd12671ed92a5b4dcf59b6bd25195644686ada81734d15fb692eabe9d1d2017e0f6882b12feea41e0846415188403227b40424592832c3505a188c9248e41d4f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4a0bead0f414010dfb4273a9e200a77e1d68247c62ff9a33560e532069a5ef9c9829185aa7310d5c2f7ad2b28afed7c8c0b51cf073795dcc2f7d61f9b143535474a956ca26ccc05d29a50c80331c00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5df9c4a1837b3dc88da7bee6197d2950797a34cf376a8dd012da473eea7971942e036a1f494896180623a6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4c78ce2512c45016197bdb96105e1f650955563d2a229e4da4d5e9694dd3172d9eb549604ca0dc70c8ae2a5618812c9d1419bf803e99173add8bf812e76771b39c60c35807d332eb7189191b3f8a89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/08b1f9192df54b92199cb865db89b589e0c076ae0c71759ae271dac96ae537e94537147c67ad32feb3d8dd6a71f763564dcbdb7a3c38346e1bb7ef9342e909958a837b2e973156261a12e897f06164\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1cfc0175661389bac5819fea9c27d4d63ca93490b0069efc6f6d8b7e0ce71fa3139528238ef1805a5767693c044cd5df72e148bbbc1d1a26896f55b5cee915d27cfa0779bbc5c0e11277ebd23264ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a4ac5a3e2243c9f8912078ebfd1c777ea6f60cbc7d6830bf08f0a8beca312404c2898c157aaaf2f6efad5de4a9578220c7b427f7c394531b22de06cff39e9a83273e817e21c295499202ac0bb46483\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d10785217126323d0662cb03478ddcaf1e62acc860877fdae65584c4701f2efb477b4d925aa559e8b6f8828a2bbfaaa413b300d7b65bda73194cac8e2fbbb3e71e8a85d4ed263d2a5a6d49fa624a26\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/957e76271159550a9b80cc8b855a32208eb2495210679d7fee97c59fd3c939d4b36e037c904035a2535ac2dfcdb4e0ae41710901b1f9b0c354388126ee6d36fd9ce7a2f22b1aa214ed60df1bc5c579\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d66c36c827681fa941d8a8e2c1b9f167a90d833ee475123a3f32e910ce66acfc21be642100e980bd5837783473e57ea2d08b65748e9f4177fc5fbbef42177db75a5b705d6c64b48bedc80a861ace02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/52186f39d680a845941a75ec1fa7fb2773913210f967933620cb85c36cf5080cc96059f0cfcba53292d9337dbba937794ffad95aaf92602fdded150a521256128f84395315d4c155bb43ad007c97ff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/74291a3e7dda325144e4713668df53ad934c1536c1ec768810f13fe6ba160fcdf858e98a4f94dac28adb936f57e9d364d7bee3d465e5f44ae7f8cc73f9bfba79b2e68c22f7c9407ad2c9866511fa19\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/233f8d8ce210b22e53f69e57e5306390a586932aa43c926d22906ad9997e435e4ffb9e679b2e7c87e32faf06fbee72eab5ea6d7ebd3ac080a09259659ad4c933954e07503deaf922a3d3cfdbb870ab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f3299dd67ecfef94440db738ca5db172eac3c15c74d954da98d8d2c3af3ae39aecce17c0158993f94764e287c8a423accff08fa8695c2f2265c9886f2436af2f1caa2e132744069cdb5c33723f5c2f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1043e9b8eb8888849b5ba861dd0c9c6b9431101a75f55a28be7f84943bd7b89978bb8a972ec5d721e3501cc44e476e6717ca83a024e18748cc476df905989cd6e1f2d09f00ae3ef7db5bf66dfcb0b5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8cb245f694a1a74b923b6bf9a64383995ac68dec595e8c89c5f1be653c3223665589df7d6c2de1c197041a4fda134eac8ec25fc31b69b9b403fb65f89aca1cde1f7ffdfeeb28c68db6f1ba738aa79e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/54b4e024d4ac03fe974be55060c93de934cfaa15c6814c20676dc332b904fc1fa57c50c3b530c0ff1c8242c5b686c28103202cedd705a366a8f4a15218172c3b711828d6a7eb4a89f4f59488fdc589\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/79c253bc10983bdfce3bc2900cbe82aa4a58b3c1df55635f7510a4821eb6c27e18f6451e0ce1275ef77354120afad1faa4ef9b667f30248d1d692ab3fb6135ffc3a7d82ae0032afb59f2336c8afb7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9dded1a6aef937d8819c30135574960de96e36cbc9ddef37a84c23a918ef0ae3d9c3edeebd01535988ac0358c43c36d3c14c18f19e471ca60f9bbe351a7a5f93c023029a2a96fc459a615249da264d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bb03d756919d8855b09f0abe66d1893aa39974a26fc8c7d1936a525b9d8e842cf4dc9d9c6ee76bc155b51f7de497dd35499d784d685b535cb7d008c71a9d0d9bfaec7fea6a3f028ec742337351f9d6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
